{
  "name": "Delivery Actions",
  "description": "What we will do for a project that is slipping or has gone quiet with the client: the cause, the plan, an owner and a date.",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "propose-action",
      "label": {
        "en": "Propose an action for a project that is slipping",
        "zh-CN": "为一个下滑的项目提出跟进措施"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-client-delivery` skill in this folder and follow it. For the project I name, read its signals and score, explain in two or three sentences what is wrong, and add one action with a concrete plan, an owner and a due date. The owner is the person who can fix it — the account lead, the project manager or finance.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-client-delivery` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的项目，读它的信号和评分，用两三句话说明问题在哪，然后加一条跟进措施，写清具体计划、负责人和截止日期。负责人是能解决问题的人——客户负责人、项目经理或财务。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-actions",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which delivery actions are overdue?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些跟进措施已经超期"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-client-delivery` skill in this folder and follow it. List open actions past their due date with their owner and project, and say whether that project’s score has moved since the action was opened. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-client-delivery` Skill，按它的规则做。列出超过截止日期仍未完成的跟进措施、负责人和对应项目，并说明措施开出以后这个项目的评分有没有变化。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
